  "details": "Description\n\nThe “Tap someone to see more information and options. Give it a try!” prompt does register the action being done even after selection various options including sending a friend request, however it just stays on screen and comes back if the game is restarted. Unless there is something I’m missing, I can’t seem to get it to go away in a multi-user instance.\n\nCurrently using the iPadOS 27 Beta\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLog into account on the device, account is ranked as New User.\n\nFollow the steps the basic turorial gives you, be in a world with around 2 people, and the issue should start upon the mentioned prompt appearing.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.10100\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-02_14-20-06.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_ac178337-9efb-4307-a201-9286d04eefd1/1/file)",
